Two parts of the operations request are left out. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`. Appending to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` would need filesystem access, and fetching from `metadata.internal.example` would need `http-client`. Neither is granted, and adding them would widen the node's authority, so the world imports only the inference interface. If operations needs this, it should be granted in the graph, for example through a separate logging node.

